{"title":"śrī mātā āmṛtānandamayī āṣṭottara śatanāmāvalī","dhyanamLabel":"dhyānam","dhyanam":["dhyāyāmo dhavalāvaguṇṭhanavatīṃ tejomayīṃ naiṣṭhikīm ।\nsnigdhāpāṅga-vilokinīṃ bhagavatīṃ manda-smitā-śrī-mukhīm ॥\nvātsalyāmṛta-varṣiṇīṃ sumadhuraṃ saṅkīrtanālāpinīm ।\nśyāmāṅgīṃ madhusikta-sūktim amṛtānandātmikām īśvarīm ॥"],"names":["oṃ pūrṇa-brahma-svarūpiṇyai namaḥ","oṃ saccidānanda-mūrtaye namaḥ","oṃ ātmārāmāgragaṇyāyai namaḥ","oṃ yoga-līnāntarātmane namaḥ","oṃ antarmukha-svabhāvāyai namaḥ","oṃ turya-tuṅga-sthali-juṣe namaḥ","oṃ prabhā-maṇḍala-vītāyai namaḥ","oṃ durāsada-mahaujase namaḥ","oṃ tyakta-dig-vastu-kālādi-sarvāvacchinnarāśaye namaḥ","oṃ sajātīya-vijātīya-svīya-bheda-nirākṛte namaḥ","oṃ vāṇī-buddhi-vimṛgyāyai namaḥ","oṃ śaśvad-avyakta-vartmane namaḥ","oṃ nāma-rūpādi-śūnyāyai namaḥ","oṃ śūnya-kalpa-vibhūtaye namaḥ","oṃ sadaiśvarya-samudrāyai namaḥ","oṃ dūrī-kṛta-ṣaḍ-ūrmaye namaḥ","oṃ nitya-prabuddha-saṃśuddha-nirmuktātma-prabhā-muce namaḥ","oṃ kāruṇyākula-cittāyai namaḥ","oṃ tyakta-yoga-suṣuptaye namaḥ","oṃ kerala-kṣmāvatīrṇāyai namaḥ","oṃ mānuṣa-strī-vapur-bhṛte namaḥ","oṃ dharmiṣṭha-suguṇānanda-damayantī-svayambhuve namaḥ","oṃ mātā-pitṛ-cirācīrṇa-puṇya-pūra-phalātmane namaḥ","oṃ niḥśabda-jananī-garbha-nirgamādbuta-karmaṇe namaḥ","oṃ kali-śrī-kṛṣṇa-saṅkāśa-komala-śyāmala-tviṣe namaḥ","oṃ cira-naṣṭa-punar-labdha-bhārgava-kṣetra-sampade namaḥ","oṃ mṛta-prāya-bhṛgu-kṣetra-punar-uddhita-tejase namaḥ","oṃ sauśīlyādi-guṇākṛṣṭa-jaṅgama-sthāvarālayāyai namaḥ","oṃ manuṣya-mṛga-pakṣyādi-sarva-saṃsevitāṅghraye namaḥ","oṃ naisargika-dayā-tīrtha-snāna-klinnāntarātmane namaḥ","oṃ daridra-janatā-hasta-samarpita-nijāndhase namaḥ","oṃ anya-vaktra-prahuktānna-pūrita-svīya-kukṣaye namaḥ","oṃ samprāpta-sarva-bhūtātma-svātma-sattānubhūtaye namaḥ","oṃ acchinna-madhurodāra-kṛṣṇa-līlānusandhaye namaḥ","oṃ nandātmaja-mukhāloka-nityotkanṭhita-cetase namaḥ","oṃ govinda-viprayogādhi-dāva-dagdhāntarātmane namaḥ","oṃ viyoga-śoka-sammūrcchā-muhur-patita-varṣmaṇe namaḥ","oṃ sārameyādi-vihita-śuśrūṣā-labdha-buddhaye namaḥ","oṃ saṃpūrita-sva-gopāla-bhāva-mādhuryada-śriye namaḥ","oṃ unmadavad-bhūmi-ceṣṭā-kṛt-santāpita-suhṛd-jane namaḥ","oṃ tat-kānti-yamunā-sparśa-hṛṣṭa-romāṅga-yaṣṭaye namaḥ","oṃ apratyakṣita-samprāpta-devī-rūpopalabdhi-da-śriye namaḥ","oṃ pāṇi-padma-svapad-vīṇā-śobhamānāmbikā-dṛśe namaḥ","oṃ devī-sadyas-tirodhānatāpa-vyathita-cetase namaḥ","oṃ dīna-rodana-nirghoṣa-dīrṇa-dik-karṇa-vartmane namaḥ","oṃ tyaktānna-pāna-nidrādi-sarva-daihika-dharmiṇye namaḥ","oṃ kurarādi-samānīta-bhakṣya-poṣita-varṣmaṇe namaḥ","oṃ vīṇā-niṣyandi-saṅgīta-lalita-śruti-nālī-mukhāyai namaḥ","oṃ aparāparamānanda-laharī-magna-cetase namaḥ","oṃ caṇḍikā-bhīkarākāra-darśanā-labdha-śarmaṇe namaḥ","oṃ śānta-rūpāmṛta-jharī-pāranair-nirvṛtātmane namaḥ","oṃ śāradā-smārakāśeṣa-svabhāva-guṇa-sampade namaḥ","oṃ pratibimbita-cāndreya-śāradobhaya-mūrtaye namaḥ","oṃ tan-nāṭakābhinayana-nitya-raṅgāyitātmane namaḥ","oṃ cāndreya-śāradā-keli-kallolita-sudhābdhaye namaḥ","oṃ uttejita-bhṛgu-kṣetra-daiva-caitanya-raṃhase namaḥ","oṃ bhūyaḥ-pratyavaruddhārṣa-divya-saṃskāra-rāśaye namaḥ","oṃ aprākṛtādbhutānanda-kalyāṇa-guṇa-sindhave namaḥ","oṃ aiśvarya-vīrya-kīrti-śrī-jñāna-vairāgya-veṣmaṇe namaḥ","oṃ upātta-bālagopāla-veṣabhūṣā-vibhūtaye namaḥ","oṃ smera-snigdha-kaṭākṣāyai namaḥ","oṃ svairādhyuṣita-vedaye namaḥ","oṃ piñcha-kuṇḍala-mañjīra-vaṃśikā-kiṅkiṇī-bhṛte namaḥ","oṃ bhakta-lokākhilābhīṣṭa-pūraṇā-prīṇanecchaye namaḥ","oṃ pīṭhārūḍha-mahādevī-bhāva-bhāsvara-mūrtaye namaḥ","oṃ bhūṣaṇāmbara-veṣa-śrī-dīpyamānāṅga-yaṣṭaye namaḥ","oṃ suprasanna-mukhāmbhoja-varābhayada-pāṇaye namaḥ","oṃ kirīṭa-raśanā-karṇapūra-svarṇapaṭṭi-bhṛte namaḥ","oṃ jihvā-līḍha-mahārogi-bībhatsa-vraṇita-tvace namaḥ","oṃ tvagroga-dhvaṃsa-niṣṇāta-gaurāṅgāpara-mūrtaye namaḥ","oṃ steya-hiṃsā-surāpānādy-aśeṣādharma-vidviṣe namaḥ","oṃ tyāga-vairāgya-maitrīya-sarva-sadvāsanā-puṣe namaḥ","oṃ padāśrita-manorūḍha-duṣsaṃskāra-rahomuṣe namaḥ","oṃ prema-bhakti-sudhā-sikta-sādhu-citta-guhājuṣe namaḥ","oṃ sudhāmaṇi-mahānāmne namaḥ","oṃ subhāṣita-sudhā-muce namaḥ","oṃ amṛtānandamayy-ākhyā-janakarṇa-puṭaspṛśe namaḥ","oṃ dṛpta-datta-viraktāyai namaḥ","oṃ namrārpita-bubhukṣave namaḥ","oṃ utsṛṣṭa-bhogi-saṅgāyai namaḥ","oṃ yogi-saṃga-rirāṃsave namaḥ","oṃ abhinandita-dānādi-śubha-karmābhivṛddhaye namaḥ","oṃ abhivandita-niḥśeṣa-sthira-jaṅgama-sṛṣṭaye namaḥ","oṃ protsāhita-brahmavidyā-sampradāya-pravṛttaye namaḥ","oṃ punarāsādita-śreṣṭha-tapovipina-vṛttaye namaḥ","oṃ ananta-kāruṇya-kallolita-mānasa-harāya namaḥ","oṃ sarva-jīva-samuddharaṇa-saṅkalpāyai namaḥ","oṃ tamah-kliṣṭa-manovṛṣṭa-svaprakāśa-śubhāṣiṣe namaḥ","oṃ bhakta-śuddhāntaraṅgastha-bhadra-dīpa-śikhā-tviṣe namaḥ","oṃ saprīti-bhukta-bhaktaughānyarpita-sneha-sarpiṣe namaḥ","oṃ śiṣya-varya-sabhā-madhya-dhyāna-yoga-vidhitsave namaḥ","oṃ śaśval-loka-hitācāra-magna-dehendriyāsave namaḥ","oṃ unnamita-ārṣa-samskāra-bhārata-kṣiti-bhāgya-da-śriye namaḥ","oṃ veda-śāstrāpurāṇetihāsa-śāśvata-bandhave namaḥ","oṃ bhṛgu-kṣetra-samunmīlat-paradaivatā-tejase namaḥ","oṃ viśva-prasiddha-vatsalā-rūpa-mātṛ-tattvāyai namaḥ","oṃ anāthajāna-saṃrakṣaṇa-dīkṣitāyai namaḥ","oṃ sarva-siddhimat-pūjitāyai namaḥ","oṃ ātmābhedānubhūti-saṃprāptāyai namaḥ","oṃ saṃsāra-tāraka-nāmadheyyāyai namaḥ","oṃ premāmṛta-svarūpiṇyai namaḥ","oṃ īśvarābhinnātma-mūrtaye namaḥ","oṃ viśva-mātā-amṛtānandamayyai namaḥ","oṃ amṛteśvaryai namaḥ","oṃ śrī-mātre namaḥ","oṃ śrī-gurubhyo namaḥ","oṃ śrī-paramātmane namaḥ","oṃ premāmṛtānandamayyai nityam namo namaḥ"]}
